# The packages of the lens tests (the geometric-lens/tests subset of test.yml),
# from a hashed lock: the CPU-only torch from PyTorch's index, then the lens
# service's requirements. A package that ci.txt also holds keeps its version
# there, because the job installs ci.txt first.
# Make lens.txt again with scripts/ci-lock.sh.
--index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu
--extra-index-url https://pypi.org/simple
-c ci.txt
-r ../../geometric-lens/requirements.txt
